STAYEASY HOTEL RESERVATION AND BILLING SYSTEM
=============================================
A console program for a small hotel. It handles room search, bookings,
check-in and check-out, cancellations, invoices and reports.
Python 3, standard library only.

FILES
-----
main.py           starts the program
models.py         Room class and the Standard, Deluxe and Suite rooms
exceptions.py     custom errors
pricing.py        bill and refund calculation
database.py      database setup, room search, loading rooms.csv
reports.py        occupancy report, revenue report, CSV export
menu.py           user input, booking steps and the main menu
rooms.csv         list of rooms (room_no,room_type,floor)
requirements.txt  empty, nothing extra to install

SETUP AND RUN
-------------
1. Install Python 3 and open a terminal in the project folder.
2. Create and activate a virtual environment:
       python -m venv venv
       venv\Scripts\activate         (Windows)
       source venv/bin/activate      (Linux or macOS)
3. pip install -r requirements.txt
4. python main.py
Run it from the project folder because rooms.csv is read from there.
If the table layout changes, delete the old stayeasy.db once.

MENU
----
1 Search room availability      7 Guest stay history
2 Create booking                8 Occupancy report
3 Check in                      9 Revenue report
4 Check out (invoice)          10 Export bookings to CSV
5 Cancel booking               11 Exit
6 View booking details

ROOMS
-----
Standard: Rs.2,500 per night, 2 guests, breakfast optional (Rs.350 each)
Deluxe:   Rs.4,000 per night, 3 guests, breakfast included
Suite:    Rs.7,500 per night, 4 guests, breakfast included

RULES
-----
- Dates are typed as DD-MM-YYYY. A stay is 1 to 30 nights and check-in must be within the next 180 days.
- The lowest-numbered free room of the chosen type is booked. If none is free, other free room types are shown and nothing is booked.
- Friday and Saturday nights cost 20% more.
- Deluxe and Suite charge Rs.800 per night for each guest after the second.
- 7 nights or more: 10% off. 3 or more finished stays: 5% off.
- GST is 12% for nights priced up to Rs.7,500 and 18% above that.
- Status flow: CONFIRMED -> CHECKED_IN -> CHECKED_OUT, or CONFIRMED -> CANCELLED. Check-in is allowed only on the check-in date.
- Refund: 7 or more days before check-in 100%, 2 to 6 days 50%, less than 2 days nothing.

OUTPUT FILES
------------
stayeasy.db, app.log (skipped rooms.csv lines), invoices,bookings_export.csv